OL,3,GNEWSAMan sprayed in face with lighter
OL,4,Afluid in Post Office robbery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man needed hospital treatment after
OL,7,Fbeing sprayed in the face with
OL,8,Fsuspected barbecue lighter fluid during
OL,9,Fa Post Office robbery.
OL,11,FIt happened just before 20:00 BST on
OL,12,FSunday on Ullswater Road in Lancaster,
OL,13,FLancashire Police said.
OL,15,FTwo men, wearing black clothes and
OL,16,Fbalaclavas, stole "a significant amount
OL,17,Fof cash from the safe", the force said.
OL,19,FThe victim, who is in his 50s, has
OL,20,Fsince been discharged, with his
OL,21,Finjuries not thought to be serious.
